From ea1e198e3ed46454874497d8faec26b180b407f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Vicory <dvicory@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 02:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): add immutable task input edges

Add board-local inputs_from edges distinct from ordering-only parents, pin exact producer task/run and handoff provenance per destination generation, enforce same-board readiness and lane limits, and expose only task IDs through the model-facing API.

Destination retries reuse the frozen generation; fan-in and fan-out remain namespaced under /workspace/inputs without granting producer Project authority.
